{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_image_sha256": "588b4288e4c737dc489d2b9bc0652cca85e3d668b1784942ef4b4bda916f1005",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "chapter": "043A",
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER043A.YBC",
      "sha256": "61b0cdb642cb28c0ece7b56bc9bb5a9860e918a3b6b6a85c685753feaeb98164",
      "text_count": 78,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 106,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "唷～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 144,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "羅弗利……！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 170,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            2
          ],
          "text": "好久不見哪。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 202,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            3,
            4
          ],
          "text": "…………\n我還以為你已經死了咧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 228,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            5
          ],
          "text": "當然，我也以為你已經往生了咧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 254,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            6
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 304,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            7,
            8,
            9,
            10,
            11
          ],
          "text": "我現在這樣不是很好嗎，在收復了安蒂米昂的\n這種好日子裡，就不要把我放出來了嘛。\n就讓我任性地，但是自由地待在這裡看看呀。\n修奈鐸那張臭臉一旦在眼前浮現，\n要是沒有個三年，可還真的忘不了呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 346,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            12
          ],
          "text": "羅弗利先生，至少請喝口茶暖暖身子吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 390,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            13,
            14,
            15,
            16
          ],
          "text": "……唉呀呀，這可真是麻煩妳了，呼呼。\n啊～這還真是好喝呀。\n真不愧是「維夏的至寶」─崔諾瓦小姐。\n就算是泡茶也能夠做到最完美的境界。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 416,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            17
          ],
          "text": "你這話也太……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 466,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            18,
            19,
            20,
            21,
            22
          ],
          "text": "說到那個該打的傢伙，我可是一點也不認同他\n。那傢伙對孕育光明的黑闇的痛恨之深呀，真\n是十分露骨。\n編織光明的手在守護秩序與律法的同時，\n也會在另一隻手裡隱藏著邪惡的黑闇……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 492,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            23
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 528,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            24,
            25,
            26,
            27
          ],
          "text": "而他竟然將這個與本質完全相反的混沌，\n拿來相提並論，\n而武斷地判定黑闇是「匍伏蔓延而來之物」的\n同類。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 572,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            28,
            29,
            30,
            31
          ],
          "text": "…………\n像您這樣的人也能瞭解黑闇所擁有的安寧，\n以及靜寂之中的美德，\n真是令人高興。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 594,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            32
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 616,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            33
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 638,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            34
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 678,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            35,
            36,
            37,
            38
          ],
          "text": "司掌光明與黑闇的聖者，\n自古以來就無法脫離人們的誤解。\n薛莉爾‧崔諾瓦，\n就請妳用那溫柔的雙手……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 704,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            39
          ],
          "text": "為混亂的愛爾梅納斯帶來希望吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 730,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            40
          ],
          "text": "羅弗利先生……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 752,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            41
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 786,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            42,
            43,
            44
          ],
          "text": "不要說得好像都是別人的事情嘛，\n羅弗利。\n你也應該要幫忙做一些事情呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 808,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            45
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 848,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            46,
            47,
            48,
            49
          ],
          "text": "你是認真的嗎？\n聖瑟維艾斯已經被他們攻陷了。\n無論是賢者圓桌或是帕蘭達因，\n都不會輕易放過與混沌有所牽連的人。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 886,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            50,
            51,
            52
          ],
          "text": "我是不會放棄法娜‧修貝流士的，\n當然，我也不會放棄夏朧‧佛洛斯蘋。\n大家也都是這樣想的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 912,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            53
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 950,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            54,
            55,
            56
          ],
          "text": "就因為這樣，現在更需要解開你的鎖鏈。\n反正這樣也不會得罪賢者圓桌他們更多了，\n大概吧……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 982,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            57,
            58
          ],
          "text": "……真是的。\n你這個傢伙，真的是個大笨蛋呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 1008,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            59
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 1040,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            60,
            61
          ],
          "text": "不，反過來說，\n你也是比任何人都要幸福的人呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 1066,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            62
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 1104,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            63,
            64,
            65
          ],
          "text": "哈哈～\n竟然讓這些孩子們敬愛你到這個程度，\n你究竟是下了多少工夫呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 1130,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            66
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 1168,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            67,
            68,
            69
          ],
          "text": "算了，沒關係。\n我傑萊特‧羅弗利可是抱著有恩必報的原則。\n對你是這樣，對賢者圓桌也是。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 1194,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            70
          ],
          "text": "羅弗利。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 1226,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            71,
            72
          ],
          "text": "好啦，什麼小事情都可以交給我辦啦。\n不管什麼都好，只要你說，我就做到。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 1252,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            73
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 1284,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            74,
            75
          ],
          "text": "…………\n倒是，我說這位兄弟呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 1310,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            76
          ],
          "text": "嗯？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "043A",
          "source_offset": 1336,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            77
          ],
          "text": "你到底什麼時候才準備放我出來啊？"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "offset": 1368,
          "opcode": 15,
          "string_index": 0,
          "target": "data/adv/dat/Chapter045.ybc"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 45,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER045.YBC",
      "sha256": "b23fe26cf2c2c398499dad021ce4312057617040814cf60986dc5f57c89dce27",
      "text_count": 40,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 114,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "下雨了呢……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 164,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "真是冰冷的雨呀……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 198,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            2
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯，就像那天一樣……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 220,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            3
          ],
          "text": "冷到彷彿要凍結的雨呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 254,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            4
          ],
          "text": "嗯……？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 288,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            5
          ],
          "text": "那是……老師出發旅行的那一天。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 310,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            6
          ],
          "text": "與吉爾梅亞閣下一起……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 344,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            7
          ],
          "text": "啊……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 378,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            8
          ],
          "text": "雨水的香氣和聲音……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 400,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            9
          ],
          "text": "令我想起了別離，雖然令人傷感，"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 422,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            10
          ],
          "text": "然而，那也是曾經一同走過的證據。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 444,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            11
          ],
          "text": "所以，雖然這樣的日子令人不捨……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 466,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            12
          ],
          "text": "我卻還是好喜歡……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 500,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            13
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 540,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            14,
            15
          ],
          "text": "而且，下過雨的話，\n深夜裡的星光將會更加地璀璨。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 574,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            16
          ],
          "text": "我們……真的回到這裡來了呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 608,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            17
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 718,
          "speaker_id": 9,
          "speaker": "伊里安",
          "text_indices": [
            18
          ],
          "text": "大家……！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 740,
          "speaker_id": 9,
          "speaker": "伊里安",
          "text_indices": [
            19
          ],
          "text": "看，快看呀……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 790,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "星星……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 852,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            21
          ],
          "text": "對呀，今天不就是……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 914,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            22
          ],
          "text": "銀鐘祭……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 976,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            23
          ],
          "text": "希望混沌永遠不要再出現……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 998,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            24
          ],
          "text": "就像這世上沒有永不結束的長夜……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 1060,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            25
          ],
          "text": "嗯……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 1082,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            26
          ],
          "text": "現在，我們還只踏出了小小的一步。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 1104,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            27
          ],
          "text": "這是我們的，小小的小小的銀鐘祭。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 1126,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            28
          ],
          "text": "然而我不會忘記，這個立下誓約的夜晚。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 1188,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            29
          ],
          "text": "我會努力的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 1210,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            30
          ],
          "text": "……就算只有一點點幫助也好。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 1232,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            31
          ],
          "text": "也希望能夠讓老師感覺我值得信賴。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 1294,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            32
          ],
          "text": "凱洛……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 1316,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            33
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯，就是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 1378,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            34
          ],
          "text": "就算到了最後，我們仍然將各分東西……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 1404,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            35
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 1450,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            36
          ],
          "text": "至少在那之前，大家也要在一起努力。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 1512,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            37
          ],
          "text": "我們就此約定。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 1574,
          "speaker_id": 8,
          "speaker": "奎絲忒",
          "text_indices": [
            38
          ],
          "text": "嗯。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 45,
          "source_offset": 1636,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            39
          ],
          "text": "加油吧……！"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "chapter": 306,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER306.YBC",
      "sha256": "dba0aad949845639934f4ae16f2b2b6af34d3fafc26a32e2e7d92ff6f6824df7",
      "text_count": 60,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 120,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            0,
            1
          ],
          "text": "唷。\n你現在有時間嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 158,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            2
          ],
          "text": "羅弗利。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 196,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            3,
            4,
            5
          ],
          "text": "什麼？\n不會浪費你很多時間的啦。\n你也千萬不要說你現在很忙唷。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 228,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            6,
            7
          ],
          "text": "……歡迎歡迎呀。\n擁有這世上少有毒舌的我的朋友。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 266,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            8,
            9,
            10
          ],
          "text": "哼。\n要是這個世界上沒有令人不滿的事情的話，\n我也就沒有理由開口說些什麼啦。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 298,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            11,
            12
          ],
          "text": "原來如此。\n總之，請進吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 336,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            13,
            14,
            15
          ],
          "text": "喔喔。\n就這麼一口答應啦。\n你這傢伙運氣還真好咧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 362,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            16
          ],
          "text": "？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 384,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            17
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 422,
          "speaker_id": 13,
          "speaker": "攸莉 ",
          "text_indices": [
            18
          ],
          "text": "……打擾了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 448,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            19
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 470,
          "speaker_id": 13,
          "speaker": "攸莉 ",
          "text_indices": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 492,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            21
          ],
          "text": "……你對她有什麼印象嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 518,
          "speaker_id": 13,
          "speaker": "攸莉 ",
          "text_indices": [
            22
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 540,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            23
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 562,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            24
          ],
          "text": "對這個輪廓是有一點印象啦，但是……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 600,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            25,
            26,
            27
          ],
          "text": "難道你想不起文克斐雷的容貌了嗎？\n那曾經待在這裡，對我們有很大的恩情，\n也一直支持著帕彌菈的冰之魔法師呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 632,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            28,
            29
          ],
          "text": "難道……\n她是伊莉絲的……？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 658,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            30
          ],
          "text": "是的，這一位正是她的妹妹。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 684,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            31
          ],
          "text": "攸莉……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 722,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            32,
            33,
            34
          ],
          "text": "就像之前所說的，\n當我們還沒有獨當一面的能力的時候……\n還真的是多虧了妳姐姐的幫助呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 748,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            35
          ],
          "text": "而妳今天到純潔之盾來又是……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 770,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            36
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 792,
          "speaker_id": 13,
          "speaker": "攸莉 ",
          "text_indices": [
            37
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 818,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            38
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 856,
          "speaker_id": 13,
          "speaker": "攸莉 ",
          "text_indices": [
            39,
            40,
            41
          ],
          "text": "我是想來確認一下，\n當初讓姐姐如此在意過的人們，\n究竟是怎麼樣的人呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 882,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            42
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 920,
          "speaker_id": 13,
          "speaker": "攸莉 ",
          "text_indices": [
            43,
            44,
            45
          ],
          "text": "而且，我也想要知道。\n你的靈魂還活著嗎？\n還是你的心已然死亡了呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 946,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            46
          ],
          "text": "唉唷……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 968,
          "speaker_id": 13,
          "speaker": "攸莉 ",
          "text_indices": [
            47
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 990,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            48
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 1012,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            49
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 1034,
          "speaker_id": 13,
          "speaker": "攸莉 ",
          "text_indices": [
            50
          ],
          "text": "所以我來到了這裡。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 1060,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            51
          ],
          "text": "……這樣啊。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 1086,
          "speaker_id": 13,
          "speaker": "攸莉 ",
          "text_indices": [
            52
          ],
          "text": "沒有其他的理由了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 1124,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            53,
            54,
            55
          ],
          "text": "……如果妳繼續待在這裡的話，\n不用太久就可以瞭解了，\n妳所想知道的一切事情……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 1156,
          "speaker_id": 13,
          "speaker": "攸莉 ",
          "text_indices": [
            56,
            57
          ],
          "text": "……是的。\n請您多多指教了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 306,
          "source_offset": 1188,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            58,
            59
          ],
          "text": "啊啊，也請妳多多指教。\n……真是沒有比這更令人開心的事情了。"
        }
      ],
